WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.710
arashi no naka de kagayaite
You see the dream shining within the storm.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:16.000
sono yume o akiramenaide
Hang on to it now! Don't let it go.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.560
kizutsuita anata no senaka no
All I want is to take those wings on your back...

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.810
tenshi no hane sotto daite
Those wounded angel wings, and gently...

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.410
daite agetai
...pull them close to me.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:39.720
aoku hatenai sora no katasumi de
Newborn in a corner of the endless blue sky...

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.000
umareta yume ga
The dream is there,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.130
ima chiisakutemo
and even though it may now be small...

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:51.000
koori tsuku you na
No matter how strong they may blow...

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.980
tsuyoi kaze de sae
...or how icy they may be...

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.750
sono mune ni kagayaku
...those winds can never erase...

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:03.180
yume o keshitari, sou yo
...the dream that shines. Oh, no!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.690
keshitari nante dekinai
The dream that shines inside your heart!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.920
arashi no naka de kagayaite
You see the dream shining within the storm.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:14.120
sono yume o akiramenaide
Hang on to it now! Don't let it go.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.720
kizutsuita anata no senaka no
All I want is to take those wings on your back...

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.960
tenshi no hane sotto daite
Those wounded angel wings, and gently...

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.340
daite agetai
...pull them close to me.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.660
<i>This is formation 3-8-6.</i>

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.020
<i>Course ahead is all green.</i>

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.820
<i>Proceeding with operation.</i>

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.890
<i>Don't get shot down</i>
<i>by any cyclops!</i>

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.930
<i>Same goes for you!</i>

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.780
Tunnel entrance confirmed!
Coordinates are...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.010
<i>Transmitting coordinates now!</i>

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.570
<i>That idiot!</i>
<i>He's left himself wide open!</i>

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.700
Damned flatlanders!

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:34.840
Even Feddies born in the
colonies become victims of gravity!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.080
They have our coordinates!
Pull back to the tunnel!

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:40.550
<i>They'll be hitting us</i>
<i>with cannon fire next!</i>

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:46.960
Got it! Eledore,
we have the coordinates!

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.330
Michel, this is incredible!
Check it out!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.760
Transferring data
to Guntank team.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.800
Would you look at all
those guys out there...

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.570
They've reshaped
the whole mountain!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.500
We're starting!

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.440
Usual procedure.
Ten shots and then we move.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.350
Gotcha. Let's do it.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.830
Direct hits? Not bad...

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.810
Will we be able to hold them
off with the forces we have?

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.170
Don't worry. The Apsalus
will be finished soon.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:41.040
And we're proceeding with the
preparations for the <i>Kergeren's</i> escape.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.740
It was Miss Aina's idea.

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:46.380
We're going back to Side 3?!

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.820
<i>Abandoning a base...</i>

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:51.550
<i>The final proof of a
soldier's incompetence.</i>

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:55.330
<i>Preparations to blow the</i>
<i>tunnel entrance are complete!</i>

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.130
<i>We've blown the shutters</i>
<i>and are now sending...</i>

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.670
<i>...Kojima battalion's</i>
<i>07th Team into the tunnel.</i>

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.240
- Do we have video?
- Yes, sir.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:08.280
Switching to hard line.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.840
<i>No sign of the enemy.</i>

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.240
<i>We're practically drowning in</i>
<i>Minovsky particles over here!</i>

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.540
<i>Cut the chatter, Sally!</i>

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.240
<i>Right, right...</i>

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.190
Explosives discovered!
Proceeding with disarmament!

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.250
This is our fourth penetration.
PLEASE let this be the one...

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.560
Let's pull the GMs back until
the bombs are disarmed.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.100
We've already
lost nine units!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.660
Only six were destroyed, sir.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.830
I don't CARE
what the number is!

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:39.930
Commander...
I placed my trust in you.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.240
If we can't find a way in...

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.410
...what would you say to our
making the mountain disappear?

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:50.270
But, without using nuclear weapons,
that won't be a simple task.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.250
We've got a high probability of
a mobile suit reactor explosion!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.650
<i>Lock filters onto all optical</i>
<i>sensors, or you'll burn them out!</i>

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.560
<i>All units,</i>
<i>brace for shock wave!</i>

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:09.170
Secure from alert. Looks like
nothing's going to blow.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.470
As long as mobile suits are
powered by nuclear reactors...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.940
...there's no way to completely avoid
battlefield accidents, correct?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.940
Are you suggesting we <i>intentionally</i>
blow up one of our?!

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.280
Operation Star One is near.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:26.510
At all costs, I want to avoid
General Revil laughing at me...

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.820
...for allowing that thing to
get up into space. Understand?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.270
That's for coming out...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.640
There's still one left!

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.050
<i>Karen! One of the</i>
<i>skirted ones, and it's fast!</i>

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.950
<i>Leave him to me.</i>

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.290
Above me?!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.140
Any way I shoot,
I'll still hit his reactor!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.080
<i>You okay, GM Head?</i>

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:29.740
Thanks... But could you
stop calling me "GM Head"?

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:35.280
<i>Propellant loading now 70% complete.</i>
<i>Continuing countdown.</i>

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:38.350
You were right!
It's getting ready to leave.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.360
<i>Our suppression forces in the</i>
<i>mining town still haven't reported in.</i>

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:46.460
Have they failed to secure
an escape route for the <i>Kergeren?</i>

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.830
I'm going out.
Reload my weaponry!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.840
Well, sir... This is the
last of our ammunition.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:59.740
I want to grant Miss Aina's
request, but!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.840
Anyone who isn't busy, please
get aboard the <i>Kergeren!</i>

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.910
Move the wounded into
the gravity block.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.550
If you can't get a seat, put on a normal
suit and move into the cargo bay!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.560
You, in the mobile suit,
please help get the wounded on board.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.470
<i>What, we in the base</i>
<i>defense team, too?!</i>

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.520
<i>Did Commandant Ginias order that?</i>

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.730
This has nothing to
do with my brother!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.810
It's a personal
request from me!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.800
<i>You lose. Help them.</i>

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.040
Norris! You're all right!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.480
So, you finally got Master
Ginias to see your point.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:41.050
I can't let these soldiers die
for my brother's delusions.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:45.450
You've gotten stronger...
Is it because you're in love?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:52.030
I'm disappointed. I was born
with feelings, too, you know.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.900
At least I had them until I chose
to be a professional soldier...

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.900
I think of you like a father, Norris,
yet I know so little about you.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:07.610
Me?! You think of me
as a father?! I'm honored!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.340
That decides it!
I'm going back out.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:15.520
You can't! If you leave now,
you won't be able to go with us!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:20.030
Doesn't matter. A person's life
is about what they've accomplished.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:24.490
Master Ginias has made his dream
come true, and that's commendable.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.630
If your wish is for
the <i>Kergeren</i> to escape...

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.800
...then it is my duty as a soldier
to help you accomplish that.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.350
Now, watch as I secure
an escape route for you.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.110
Don't die!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.780
Niever!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.400
I can't stop him!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.120
If anything happens
to Norris, then!

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.620
Good luck, sir!

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.430
...then I'M the
one who killed him!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:35.830
And when that happens...
I won't let you go alone!

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:44.680
I never thought Miss Aina
would so resemble her father.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.980
<i>Sanders here. I'm in position.</i>

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.990
<i>Karen here. In position.</i>

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.090
<i>All units, prep for cannon fire!</i>

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.160
<i>We'll stand by till we get</i>
<i>orders from the main force.</i>

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:05.430
<i>Let's grab some chow.</i>

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.800
Roger. What do
you want to eat?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.670
Shut up!

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.900
It's your turn
to make the food!

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:13.670
I've heard this sound before...

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.210
Commander, better save
the chow for later.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:21.940
<i>Something's coming.</i>

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.210
From where?!

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.780
Dammit! The sound
keeps moving around!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.930
An elevator...
It's coming from underground!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.960
<i>Sanders, front-left of you!</i>

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.330
It's fast!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.880
One command truck,
three human-types.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:56.280
Three tanks, one directly below.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.620
Just one unit?
Sheesh... We're insulted.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.020
<i>He's so close, he's in my</i>
<i>blind spot! Take him, Karen!</i>

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.830
Those human-types
have beam weapons, too!

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:12.530
That slowpoke <i>Kergeren</i> will
be easy pickings for them!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.870
Gotcha!

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.460
<i>Damn! He's in that</i>
<i>open-shaft building!</i>

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.700
<i>Leave him to me!</i>

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.640
I can guess where he
is if he's falling...

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:28.520
THERE!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.220
<i>Did you get him?</i>

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.220
ONE!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.970
He's just playing
with Sanders and me!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:55.470
He's already taken a tank out...
This guy's an ace!

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.550
I appreciate you giving me
an escape route! Thanks!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:14.280
My field of vision sucks...
Eledore!

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:15.350
Yeah?

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.920
<i>Take command.</i>

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:19.020
You want me to WHAT?!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.570
I can't follow his
movements from here!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.640
<i>I need to depend on your ears!</i>

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.170
All right! Leave it to me!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.740
08th Team, you are
now under my command!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.180
God help us...

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.440
You say something?

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.210
No, not a thing, sir!

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.940
- <i>Sanders!</i>
- <i>Yeah?</i>

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:39.990
<i>Nothing personal, but thinking of him</i>
<i>as a regular Zeek will get you killed!</i>

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.290
<i>This guy's better than us!</i>

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.350
Oh? At last,
the <i>real</i> battle begins...

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:54.760
Trying to stir up
more smoke, huh?!

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.700
He's headed for you!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:00.970
<i>Tell me something</i>
<i>I don't know!</i>

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.040
<i>Dammit, where's he coming from?!</i>

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:13.780
<i>You son of a bitch!</i>

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:19.820
Not there?! Oh, hell!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.700
He's going for the cockpit!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.970
<i>I've got him, Master Chief!</i>

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:45.950
GOTCHA!!!
Overhead, 6-4-9 by 2-3!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.950
<i>Unit 301, FIRE!!!</i>

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.220
Just one left...

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:59.560
Apsalus final check
routines, now running.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.970
All green.
The Apsalus is complete.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:13.900
It's been a long,
hard road. I thank you.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:15.910
Cheers!

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.350
Excuse me.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.460
Please, enjoy your drinks.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.300
<i>Thanks, Eledore!</i>

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.210
Come on!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.660
Yes, be afraid! Shrink back!

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:17.270
Die knowing you couldn't use your
mobile suit to its full power!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.510
If I play this defensively,
I lose. Gotta attack!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.790
You're making this fun for me!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.460
HERE'S IT BACK, WITH INTEREST!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.900
That certainly
<i>looked</i> impressive...

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:49.700
...but the tank's
about to be scrapped!

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:53.640
I have to make it!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.320
<i>It's over!</i>

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.860
Miss Aina!

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:15.660
I'm afraid I won't make
that rendezvous...

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.930
...because I've found
where I'm going to die!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:29.850
Miss Aina! We just sighted a
signal flare from Captain Norris.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.890
What color was it?!
How is he?!

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:37.080
It was red...

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:40.920
"Unable to return.
Launch the <i>Kergeren..."</i>

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:42.860
Yes.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.190
Kergeren <i>now ready for lift-off.</i>

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:47.960
<i>Beginning to cut</i>
<i>energy pipes to the base.</i>

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.460
Gentlemen...

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:55.170
While it pains me to say goodbye
to you all, the time has come.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.810
Relax and get some rest.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.390
The Apsalus is mine alone!

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.250
The <i>Kergeren</i> takes
off in 20 minutes.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.420
It's time I started
using a few tricks!

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:25.940
Out of ammo?!

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.220
He just got my left arm!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:58.800
Your reflexes are good, but
that won't be enough for this!

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.110
Relying on your eyes
is your fatal weakness!

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.170
Dammit!
Where's the main circuit?!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.860
He's coming?!

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:36.240
Why won't he shoot?!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.180
FINISH ME, FOR GOD'S SAKE!!!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.590
<i>Thanks, I owe you one.</i>

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.090
<i>Shut up and go, already.</i>

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.230
<i>Gotcha.</i>

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.200
<i>So, what do we do now,</i>
<i>acting commander?</i>

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.290
<i>If we could just get to the</i>
<i>weapons in the container...</i>

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.200
Shut up! He'd kill him
while we were trying!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.040
Just defend that tank!
No matter what!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.540
It's time I stopped
playing around.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:13.400
What'll you do?!
The pilot's still alive!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.810
<i>Here he comes, Sanders!</i>

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.150
<i>Right.</i>

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.620
Dammit, hands, do what I want!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.930
My friends... Unit 301!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:30.260
Who am I to tell them
to get back alive?!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.500
Who cares about fighting
for your friends?!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.300
All I know is I'm <i>scared!</i>

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.670
I WANT TO LIVE!!!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.480
Oh? Are you awake now?

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.800
<i>I'M GOING TO LIVE!!!</i>

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.530
<i>I'm going to live...</i>

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.580
...AND MARRY AINA!!!

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.480
YOU'RE the one?!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.070
Careless of me!

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:28.280
The commander! He's lost it!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:32.750
Fools who stop wallowing in
self-pity really can be strong.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.980
He's back!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.330
That sound...

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.700
No time to
celebrate, guys!

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.630
Aina's about to make
a reappearance!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:55.810
Now firing.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.540
Excellent. Let it begin.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.560
<i>What the hell?!</i>

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:35.250
So, I've met Miss Aina's lover.
Life can be funny, sometimes...

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:38.150
<i>However... I won't lose!</i>

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.420
I'VE WON!!!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.110
Oh, no!

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:09.850
I've lost...

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:40.810
Listen, everyone.
I'm leaving the service.

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:54.260
osanaikoro kara
All that time that's passed me by.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:57.950
sou kyou made no so many days
From childhood till now, so many days.

00:22:58.030 --> 00:23:02.090
furikaereba ironna
When I look back, I see so many things...

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:05.860
koto ni meguriatta
...that happened to come into my life.

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.030
naitari warattari
The times I cried, the times I laughed.

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:13.040
kenka shitari yume mitari
The times I fought, the times I dreamed.

00:23:13.110 --> 00:23:17.170
chotto hard na shitsuren mo
The lost loves that were sort of hard.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:20.310
kagayaku my history
All shining in my history.

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:23.450
ikutsumono
The ones who caused me pain...

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:28.320
deai to wakare kugurinukete
...I met and left along the way.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:34.190
ai suru anata ni sou yo
But I still ended up meeting you.

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:38.530
Love! meguriaeta
The one that I love.

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:43.430
Ten years after juunen go no
Ten years after, A decade from now.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:47.200
watashi wa doushiteru darou
I wonder what I will be doing then.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:54.340
donna fuu ni anata o sukideiru darou
I wonder how I will be still loving you.

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:58.450
Ten years after, juunen go no
Ten years after, a decade from now.

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:02.520
anata o mitsumete mitai
I still want to be looking at you.

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:06.260
Stay together sono toki
Stay together. When that day comes...

00:24:06.330 --> 00:24:12.950
kitto soba de hohoendeitai
...I want to be at your side with a smile.

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:20.040
Karen...

00:24:20.630 --> 00:24:22.200
Sanders...

00:24:24.010 --> 00:24:25.670
Eledore...

00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:27.050
Michel...

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:30.920
Don't die. We'll meet again.

00:24:40.570 --> 00:24:43.460
Next time,
"The Shuddering Mountain (Part 2)"
